(7733744, 1274404, 114285, '<td valign="top">Just coming back to comment on a few images after voting already.<br/> <br/>Some of the architecture in those Arabian countries is just magnificent, thank you for giving us a slice this week.</td>', 'Just coming back to comment on a few images after voting already. Some of the architecture in those Arabian countries is just magnificent, thank you for giving us a slice this week.', '2022-12-01 20:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7733745, 1274375, 173844, '<td valign="top">Shift one''s vision from this glorious, tingling hyper-reality and you might see an abstract of textures and luminous gashes, an urban pelt.  So very much here, neither shy nor apologetic.  The very angle of perspective is dizzying.  Black and white is a choice that makes it happen, a meticulous etching that, without a camera, could take years to accomplish.  Like an Escher without the trickery.  Tour de force.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Shift one''s vision from this glorious, tingling hyper-reality and you might see an abstract of textures and luminous gashes, an urban pelt.  So very much here, neither shy nor apologetic.  The very angle of perspective is dizzying.  Black and white is a choice that makes it happen, a meticulous etching that, without a camera, could take years to accomplish.  Like an Escher without the trickery.  Tour de force.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2022-12-01 22:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7733746, 1274488, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely curves, a fiesta primed for St. Patrick''s Day.  A photobomber?  More like a scene-stealer.  The fly''s eyes nicely echo the leaves.  Is such beauty transitory, or rather a matter of attention?  Stellar response to the challenge.</td>', 'Lovely curves, a fiesta primed for St. Patrick''s Day.  A photobomber?  More like a scene-stealer.  The fly''s eyes nicely echo the leaves.  Is such beauty transitory, or rather a matter of attention?  Stellar response to the challenge.', '2022-12-01 22:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7733747, 1274480, 173844, '<td valign="top">Curves upon curves, a splendid fanfare.  One might see this as a fine botanical illustration, or take it in the wind, its buoyant freedom heedless of being anchored to its place in the world.  What more can one need?</td>', 'Curves upon curves, a splendid fanfare.  One might see this as a fine botanical illustration, or take it in the wind, its buoyant freedom heedless of being anchored to its place in the world.  What more can one need?', '2022-12-01 22:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
