(7733751, 1274501, 83313, '<td valign="top">Excellent choice. You sure have a variety of shots available around downtown Chicago. Reminds me of my first couple of years on DPC, when I kept going to the Ft. Worth Stockyards for every challenge. I thought I was being lazy, but eventually realized that the challenges were forcing me to look at the same place a different way each time, and explore parts of it that most tourists never see.</td>', 'Excellent choice. You sure have a variety of shots available around downtown Chicago. Reminds me of my first couple of years on DPC, when I kept going to the Ft. Worth Stockyards for every challenge. I thought I was being lazy, but eventually realized that the challenges were forcing me to look at the same place a different way each time, and explore parts of it that most tourists never see.', '2022-12-01 22:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
